Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonderland!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.03,0:01:53.70,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(900,0)\3c&H2A2A2A&\c&H2A2A2A&\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)}Showdown at Alubarna
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.03,0:01:53.70,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\fad(900,0)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Showdown at Alubarna
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:01:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I looked him straight in the eye\Nand yelled, "You bowlegged bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And ever since that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.51,0:02:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crabs throughout the world have been\Nself-conscious about being bow-legged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the reason\Nthey walk sideways? Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and at that pivotal moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a lobster happened to be within\Nearshot and heard the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so lobsters are crabs too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better believe it. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, why don't you relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.51,0:02:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just wasting your energy doing\Nthat. Who asked you? Excuse him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.03,0:02:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's hopeless
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.47,0:02:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys like Zoro they got to keep\Nmoving or they won't stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have one-track minds especially
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our own resident muscle freak here now that\Nhe's had a taste of the seven warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop whining just say what's\Non your mind or shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you need me to spell it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.61,0:02:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this tough guy bluster\Nis just a sad attempt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.49,0:02:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to mask your fear that\NLuffy might lose this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.11,0:03:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saying I'm scared, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me, fancy eyebrows! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn Moss Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna go at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! This is pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.75,0:03:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.77,0:03:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're at each other's throats!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's worked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to me as Vice-Captain to\Ntake charge! Calm down! All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.69,0:03:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's frightened, yes, but\Nwe mustn't turn on each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's cowering on us\Nto meet him in Alubarna!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you see more\Non eggs than any of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your mind on the Rebellion\Nand leave the rest to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.01,0:03:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we tear each other\Napart, we've already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's devote our\Nattention to Elabarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scissors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name for the crab. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just baked that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got something better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.50,0:04:10.29,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord2.75\fad(950,0)\3c&H040404&\c&HE6E6E5&\1a&HFF&\t(905,950,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,783)}Yuba\NFormer Rebel Base Camp
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.50,0:04:10.29,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord0\fad(950,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\4a&HFF&\pos(720,783)}Yuba\NFormer Rebel Base Camp
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precious water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water is coming forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This land is strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, Yuba lives on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sandstorm will deal Yuba\Na final destructive blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.05,0:04:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Banning the flames of anger within the\Nrebel army until an inferno ignites!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, the bleeding hearts which\Ninfest this land are what's killing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Straw Hat Luffy,\Nare the worst of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only you had purged\Nyourself of such weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may have lived a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you don't feel so\Nindebted to this water now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks like it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll be out of\Nyour misery soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a complete waste of my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we've weathered this storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain will bless us with sweet relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your winds will never vanquish us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cowardly storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuba will never give in to the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.65,0:06:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to Alubarna?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we chasing after\Nthe Straw Hat Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.43,0:07:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or, uh, reinforcing the Royal Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to decide which is\Nmore important when you get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, sir, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rely on your sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, I'll\Naccept responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to head out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something unforeseen has come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.85,0:07:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be on alert to receive\Ncommunication from me at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to keep a vigilant eye on\Nthis country and where it ends up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.19,0:07:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it falls or whether it survives,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dawn of a brand new and\Nhistoric age is on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.65,0:07:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.59,0:07:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your orders! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.03,0:08:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it falls or whether it survives,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dawn of a brand new and\Nhistoric age is on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our target is the pirate Straw Hat\NLuffy and everyone who serves under him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All hands, reinforce your gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to depart for Alubarna. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brethren and I are\Nwilling to defend Alabasta
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with every last drop\Nof blood in our bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will die before turning it over to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.44,0:08:52.36,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\bord0\c&HFBFBFC&\fs105\fsp0\fnAsul\b700\blur0.9\pos(720,769)}Alubarna, the Capital
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop dawdling around and focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need more cannonballs over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's number is said\Nto be well over two million.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, soldier, what do you think\Nof His Majesty's attack on Nanohana?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have served His Majesty for over\Nten years, and I was quite surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's really no way\Nanyone could rationalize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Logic would suggest something\Nhas happened to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.89,0:09:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If true, it is all the more reason\Nwhy we must not lose this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bury your fear deep, for your king's\Nsake, as well as that of Princess Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will defend this country at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone who is not prepared to\Nfight, take shelter outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot guarantee your safety\Nif you would like to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.61,0:09:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't get out of here,\Nwe'll be in the line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Banks are getting hectic\Ndown there, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.31,0:09:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's still moving too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and fight already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see him waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't care if\Nhe is or isn't the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to go out of my mind if I have\Nto stand here guarding him any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.99,0:10:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't! Can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.93,0:10:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slipping past the palace guards and\Nkidnapping this royal pain in the rear
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a mission which only a team of\Nour accomplished skills can pull off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now that it's over, this\Nassignment has become a tedious bore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anything I said manage to seep\Nthrough that thick head of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, you're so slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, my back is killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, Koza, you mustn't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you embody the\Nspirit of this great country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divided, you only weaken her resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.43,0:10:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are those who lament war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and those who race towards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go ahead and run away. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, others incite war.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for the very few who know the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they strive to prevent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These widely opposing viewpoints\Nall have one thing in common.
