Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.23,0:11:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are about to clash here in\Nthe capital city of Alubarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean we\Ncan't cross this river?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.87,0:11:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving crabs are creatures of the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't take to water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.69,0:11:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has everyone gone nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.33,0:11:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can exist on land and water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.49,0:11:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we just carelessly spend our\Nenergy swimming across the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See here after the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's tons of desert to deal with So if
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:11:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this crab can't make\Nit to the other shore,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are we supposed to run the\Nrest of the way on foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can see it Sandora\NRiver straight ahead. Oh great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us scissors pretty please I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.33,0:12:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scissors loves dancer girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.33,0:12:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will this do? Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.59,0:12:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's looking this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're accelerating!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bobby's won!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, now we've got two animals in heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, we're moving now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what exactly has this\Nsolved, Chopper? Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.37,0:13:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing it, but I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.17,0:13:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This crab is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't you stop, just keep on going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run, run, run all the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love this crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't know better,\NI think we were sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid crab! It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.01,0:13:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No use whining about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.13,0:13:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure there are\Nany boats around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long will it take\Nus to reach the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, sisters! Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the reason we're in this mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Sandoran catfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.03,0:14:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're rarely seen by humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem that rare to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I mention they love\Nto eat human flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.17,0:14:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could've told us a bit sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.95,0:14:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing with\Nyou hanging on so tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kong Fu to Kong Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say they were just looking\Nout for their fellow pupils.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pupils? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.53,0:14:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think Luffy's our master?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.27,0:14:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really want to argue with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, little guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little further!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that things are going\Nsmoothly, can we make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even riding Eyelash, I'm not\Nsure when we would get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to be pessimistic, but\NEyelash can only carry two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Baroque Works is gonna attack\Nus, it'll be from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we can't split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way for\Nus to stick together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they're\Nhere to kill us already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait! That sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.05,0:15:34.14,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord2.75\fad(900,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,715.4)}Squadron Leader Karoo\NSupersonic Duck Squad\N(Swiftest Unit in Arabasta)
Dialogue: 2,0:15:29.05,0:15:34.14,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord0\fad(900,0)\c&HE4E6E6&\4a&HFF&\pos(720,715.4)}Squadron Leader Karoo\NSupersonic Duck Squad\N(Swiftest Unit in Arabasta)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Supersonic Duck Squadron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've come to help us, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat! Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.89,0:16:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may both be pirates, but you\Nfall grossly short on skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sandstorm will deal Yuba\Na final destructive blow,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,banning the flames of anger within the\Nrebel army until an inferno ignites.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.35,0:17:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those of you with the name of D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are your intentions?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently you don't have a\Nclue what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:17:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.09,0:18:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awake already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've studied your ability,\Nthis won't turn out like last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.07,0:18:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't want to overexert yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.31,0:18:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you save the boy before he dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, if it weren't for\Nhis courage and selflessness,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who knows if your precious princess\Nwould have made it back alive at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must please you to know Vivi's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That even as we speak, she's\Non her way to Alubarna,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.12,0:18:42.29,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord2.75\fad(900,0)\pos(720,585)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)}Accelegator\NThe Second Fastest\NAnimal in Arabasta
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.12,0:18:42.29,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord0\c&HE4E6E6&\fad(900,0)\pos(720,585)\4a&HFF&}Accelegator\NThe Second Fastest\NAnimal in Arabasta
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.12,0:18:42.29,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord2.75\fad(900,0)\fscy230\pos(720,593)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)}(                                )
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.12,0:18:42.29,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord0\c&HE4E6E6&\fad(900,0)\fscy230\pos(720,593)\4a&HFF&}(                                )
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though it's a long trip\Nand anything could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.65,0:18:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess the situation is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.71,0:19:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not able to stop her, then who can?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi must be protected\Nfor everyone's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.57,0:19:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need meat!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.73,0:19:17.32,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,550)\b700\pos(720,761)\bord0\c&HFDFEFD&\fnAsul\blur0.9\fs105\fsp0}Nanohana, a Port Town
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, the final revolt has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a lone ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully that means\NPrincess Vivi and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were able to make it to\NAlabasta in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.61,0:19:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pray there's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need food now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.25,0:19:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the least of your worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I'll get a doctor for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.57,0:19:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make sure\NCrocodile pays for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:20:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He insulted Phoebe, and that old\Nman with this shovel gave me water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's definitely gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still in the distance,\Nbut it's Alubarna!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, we're less than 30 minutes away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.85,0:20:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're nearing Alubarna now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has come, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.43,0:20:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, we've sighted the Rebel Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're about 10 miles to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their forces are bearing down on\Nthe southern gate as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,East, west, south, southeast, southwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guard each gate with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not let even one of them set\Nfoot within our walls. Right!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.53,0:21:26.54,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fad(0,1800)\3c&H222222&\c&H222222&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\fsp2.25\bord4\pos(720,767.8)\t(4210,4255,\1a&HFF&)\t(4930,6010,0.3,\bord2)}{Alubarna: West Gate -OG}West Gate, Alubarna{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 2,0:21:20.53,0:21:26.54,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur1\fad(0,1800)\c&HFAFCFB&\4a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,767.8)\b0\fsp2.25\t(4210,6010,0.1,\1a&HFF&)}{Alubarna: West Gate -OG}West Gate, Alubarna{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:20.53,0:21:26.54,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur1\fad(0,1800)\c&HFAFCFB&\4a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,767.8)\b0\fsp2.25}{Alubarna: West Gate -OG}West Gate, Alubarna{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.09,0:21:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, take a look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.15,0:21:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebel army is approaching,\Nand there are so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The princess is such a little\Nidiot to think she can stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, is the little idiot even coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now will she show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will she not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.87,0:21:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will she not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The outcome is vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, what, what, what, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we be sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The princess and the pirates are\Nreally coming right at this break.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebel army's gonna beat them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.15,0:21:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought those idiots\Nwanted to stop the fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.55,0:21:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't they at least try to be on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.31,0:21:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's entirely possible that\Nthey won't make it soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.39,0:22:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might even be likely, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, they did lose precious\Ntime when they were in Rain Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.13,0:22:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? They did?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's suppose the rebellion\Ndoes get started first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to\Ndo if that does happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.57,0:22:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have to do anything, would we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.07,0:22:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.98,0:22:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the rebellion gets underway,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.27,0:22:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nothing even the princess\Nwill be able to do to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.79,0:22:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we need to do is eliminate\Nwhoever we're told to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you even manage to figure\Nthat much out on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.73,0:22:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you're just dying\Nto see some of my dance moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down and let it go, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.61,0:22:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! My back! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.39,0:22:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here and massage it, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.85,0:22:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.76,0:22:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're coming... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.17,0:22:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.21,0:22:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us\Nthat earlier, you idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.99,0:22:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ducks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on ducks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.53,0:22:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on ducks. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.05,0:22:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like their number's gone up, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:22:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are six of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.03,0:23:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Straw Hat out of the way, I thought\Nthere was only supposed to be four left!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.95,0:23:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite, Miss Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.61,0:23:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what the boss said?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.37,0:23:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told us there's that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.07,0:23:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince guy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.11,0:23:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And apparently there's more than one\Nof them, so the numbers do add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.61,0:23:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.59,0:23:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.83,0:23:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe is our only target.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.15,0:23:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.05,0:23:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.23,0:23:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, you say Princess Vivi\Nis the only one we need to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.03,0:23:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eliminate?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how about you take a stab\Nat guessing which one she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.11,0:23:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all wearing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.07,0:23:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,identical outfits!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.27,0:23:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even worse, those birds are the\Nquickest in the whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.11,0:23:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supersonic ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.07,0:23:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sneaky rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.89,0:23:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to tell\Nwhich one is Phoebe like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.31,0:23:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just not a fair\Nthing to do, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.87,0:24:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them have it down, Mr. Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.03,0:24:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.19,0:24:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss him, those damn\Nbirds, they're too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.51,0:24:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two just broke off from the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.53,0:24:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're splitting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.79,0:24:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're planning\Nto go for the south gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.19,0:24:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are heading straight\Ntoward the rebel army.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.05,0:24:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means one of them must be Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.91,0:24:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go ahead and take care of those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.01,0:24:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.35,0:24:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special attack, firestorm
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.19,0:24:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two more of them are\Nbreaking off that way, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.77,0:24:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.68,0:24:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could be Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.65,0:24:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems they're planning to\Ngo in through the West Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.59,0:24:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.43,0:24:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.51,0:25:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.45,0:25:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head for the Southwest Gate now!
