Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.53,0:25:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're going to approach three of\NAlibarna's five gates from the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.03,0:25:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're gonna split up and enter\Nthat way, then we'll do the same thing.
