Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.15,0:25:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can wipe them out inside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.19,0:25:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.35,0:25:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.89,0:25:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it the Rebels?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.11,0:25:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.65,0:25:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Supersonic Duck Squadron!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.77,0:25:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.97,0:25:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.15,0:25:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.99,0:25:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're\Ngetting away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.33,0:25:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hair! Hair! Hair! Hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.59,0:26:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teeheehee!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for\Nfollowing us all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.73,0:26:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.67,0:26:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.69,0:26:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow you guys are very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.65,0:26:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.03,0:26:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the real princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.19,0:26:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bb What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.10,0:26:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.05,0:26:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the real princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.83,0:26:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bb
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.09,0:26:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this is far enough now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.91,0:26:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say it's really entertaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.13,0:26:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How easily you all fell for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.07,0:26:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we can go ahead and take\Nthese silly cloaks along.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.73,0:26:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like your guess was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.95,0:26:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wado?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.81,0:26:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.01,0:27:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.61,0:27:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebel army is almost to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.39,0:27:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.87,0:27:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Camel!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.29,0:27:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I recognize you from the\Nship, too, don't I? Saru!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.29,0:27:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.65,0:27:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.56,0:27:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you keep quiet over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.11,0:27:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fooled us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.97,0:27:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.91,0:27:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know that anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.87,0:27:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cleared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.31,0:27:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like there won't\Nbe any rebellion now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.47,0:27:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.89,0:27:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to stop them at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.05,0:27:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't, then all of this\Nstruggling has been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.71,0:27:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever the cost,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.17,0:27:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi and her friends must be prevented\Nfrom making contact with the rebel army.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.81,0:27:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Secure the cannonballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.45,0:27:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want them rolling away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.33,0:27:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.61,0:27:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man your posts!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.87,0:28:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep the artillery under control!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.51,0:28:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground is really moving, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.97,0:28:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy army is made up\Nof two million angry men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.17,0:28:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the ground shakes\Na little bit for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.13,0:28:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.51,0:28:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.83,0:28:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.31,0:28:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could get trampled,\Nso just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.45,0:28:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, leader, please\Nlisten to what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.89,0:28:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.71,0:28:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.13,0:28:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close your ranks and stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.21,0:28:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll knock through the\Nguards at the southern gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.71,0:29:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest will fall from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.07,0:29:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not lose arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.33,0:29:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rebel Army, you must stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.67,0:29:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fight is pointless, it's all a Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.65,0:29:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please slow down, you\Nhave got to listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.39,0:29:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rebel Army, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.41,0:29:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you see a person\Nstanding in front of us just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.81,0:29:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Person?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.72,0:29:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't important right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.45,0:29:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy is already shooting at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.57,0:29:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.17,0:29:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither side can see anything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.71,0:29:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the Royal Army thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.49,0:29:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.79,0:30:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't given anyone\Nthe order to open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.57,0:30:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not act without my Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.27,0:30:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sir, I'm terribly sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.91,0:30:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess my hand just slipped. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.87,0:30:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't back down! Charge through!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.23,0:30:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a cloud of sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.27,0:30:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.21,0:30:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.43,0:30:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight for the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.09,0:30:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make the king pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.63,0:30:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.57,0:30:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.33,0:31:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.27,0:31:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing! It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.77,0:31:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I imagining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.37,0:31:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.27,0:31:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.18,0:31:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today will be our final battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.03,0:31:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.21,0:31:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.59,0:31:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.99,0:31:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.47,0:31:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.75,0:32:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.47,0:32:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.19,0:32:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tear down Alubarna!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.17,0:33:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.37,0:33:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo, you shielded me from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.25,0:33:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.01,0:33:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.09,0:33:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've done so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.53,0:33:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the rebellion has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.63,0:33:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, but I will stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.77,0:33:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times they refuse to\Nlisten, no matter how loudly I have to yell,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.17,0:33:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will not let mindless fighting\Ndestroy what we've worked so hard for.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.27,0:33:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something I learned\Nwhile I was on board the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.03,0:33:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not ever give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.65,0:33:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.45,0:33:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.61,0:33:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.63,0:33:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.73,0:33:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and hop on! Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.87,0:33:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.97,0:33:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget about that bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.03,0:33:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.31,0:33:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we need to get going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.27,0:34:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.43,0:34:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.95,0:34:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.13,0:34:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, the rebellion\Nwill only get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.81,0:34:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, prove yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.47,0:34:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.69,0:34:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't believe that it's me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.39,0:34:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.59,0:34:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.81,0:34:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.72,0:34:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.83,0:34:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eyelash, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.23,0:34:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.69,0:34:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it morning already?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.13,0:34:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.41,0:34:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is how our fight turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.61,0:34:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The part of the mission where we\Nlured them away went really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.41,0:34:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, well, you see, then\Nit was over in two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.75,0:34:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second each.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.25,0:34:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have held out longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.71,0:35:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.95,0:35:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ducks got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.43,0:35:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They came to get some help for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.93,0:35:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that aside, you let Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.17,0:35:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two get away, didn't you? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.75,0:35:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.77,0:35:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That creepy ballerina's\Ntransformations are perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.23,0:35:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no telling when he might pose as
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.17,0:35:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of us and make an\Nattempt on Vivi's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.23,0:35:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does everyone understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.25,0:35:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ever feel like one\Nof us is acting suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.55,0:35:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ask them to take off this\Nwrapping and reveal their mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.49,0:35:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they can't do that,\Nthey're an imposter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.59,0:35:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having such a well-thought-out plan like
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.67,0:35:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this seems uncharacteristically\Nsmart for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.43,0:35:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how can we be sure you\Naren't already an imposter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.53,0:35:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stab you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.75,0:35:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.51,0:35:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, definitely Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.35,0:35:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.13,0:35:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not really Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.35,0:36:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.91,0:36:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.39,0:36:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew how.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.53,0:36:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought my imitation was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.03,0:36:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We even had a helpful\Nreport from the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.49,0:36:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you all had the same bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.93,0:36:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wrapped up on your arm like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.83,0:36:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So smart of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.37,0:36:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.85,0:36:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe's in danger!

